Well done today. lab rats.

115
00:06:48.501 --> 00:06:49.502
Wonderful work.

116
00:06:49.627 --> 00:06:52.046
We all made
a spectacular amount of money.

117
00:06:53.256 --> 00:06:55.258
Today we proved the adage that

118
