194
00:10:17.293 --> 00:10:18.503
No problems.

195
00:10:18.628 --> 00:10:19.671
Right.

196
00:10:19.796 --> 00:10:21.422
- Ken.
- Mm.

197
00:10:21.548 --> 00:10:22.924
Why don't you go
and try and find

198
