- How are you?

213
00:11:17.937 --> 00:11:20.106
- Congratulations.
- Thank you.

214
00:11:20.231 --> 00:11:22.692
I'm looking so much forward
to gloating through the room.

215
00:11:22.775 --> 00:11:25.612
