567
00:36:20.189 --> 00:36:21.149
Are you mad. Max?

568
00:36:21.274 --> 00:36:22.317
Who cares? Just do it.

569
00:36:22.442 --> 00:36:23.443
Don't tell anybody. all right?

570
00:36:23.568 --> 00:36:25.945
Especially not that
little shit. Kenny.

571
00:36:26.070 --> 00:36:27.780
