594
00:38:35.283 --> 00:38:36.618
It's cosmetic stuff mostly. I'd say.

595
00:38:36.701 --> 00:38:39.746
Surprising. actually.
how well it's been maintained.

596
00:38:39.871 --> 00:38:41.122
Hmm. So you don't need

597
