667
00:43:28.326 --> 00:43:30.370
Monsieur Max!

668
00:43:30.453 --> 00:43:31.538
Yes?

669
00:43:31.621 --> 00:43:35.583
There is. um... a person

670
00:43:35.667 --> 00:43:37.377
