709
00:45:18.895 --> 00:45:20.563
Far too sweet. Charlie;
I'm not buying it.

710
00:45:20.688 --> 00:45:21.856
You need some
legal advice. mate.

711
00:45:21.981 --> 00:45:23.816
and you need it fast.
in case the little minx

712
00:45:23.900 --> 00:45:25.610
