777
00:48:53.359 --> 00:48:55.028
Her name is Fanny Chenal.

778
00:48:56.613 --> 00:48:57.530
Right.

779
00:48:57.614 --> 00:48:58.698
Many times. I've seen

780
00:48:58.823 --> 00:49:01.534
