781
00:49:01.618 --> 00:49:03.328
But you deserve credit.

782
00:49:03.411 --> 00:49:04.871
Why is that?

783
00:49:04.954 --> 00:49:07.207
You are now the town hero
for making her show

784
00:49:07.332 --> 00:49:08.875
